    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1781">

                <pb facs="1297" n="1181" xml:id="pg1181"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11D29/105.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 21, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Panama has agreed to submit to arbitration only the claims growing out of riot
                    July 4, 1912. Claims incidental to subsequent riots have not yet been presented.
                    I should be glad to know as soon as arbitration is decided upon.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
